{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901038230010","name":"凛世","text":"フォンダンショコラ……","trans":"熔岩巧克力……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ちょっとだけレンジで温めてくれ、ってさ\r\n──フォークで割ると、チョコが出てくるらしい","trans":"说是用微波炉稍微热一下就行\n──用叉子切开，巧克力就会流出来","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901038230020","name":"凛世","text":"────割る……\r\nでは……","trans":"────切开……\n那么……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901038230030","name":"凛世","text":"半分に……\r\nするのですね……？","trans":"要分成……\n两半呢……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}